---
title: Contact
description: How to reach the people behind nullish.
---

nullish is developed by [Fluster GmbH](https://fluster.ch) in Zürich, Switzerland.

## Email

Write to [hi@nullish.ch](mailto:hi@nullish.ch) for questions about nullish, feedback, or if you'd like to become a tester.

## Bugs and feature requests

Found a bug or missing something? Open an issue on [GitHub](https://github.com/usenullish/nullish/issues). Please check the existing issues first, it may already be reported.

## Security issues

Vulnerabilities have their own process, so they can be fixed before they're made public. Follow the steps on the [Security](/en/security/) page.

## Status

Is nullish down? Check [nullishstatus.com](https://nullishstatus.com) for the current status and past incidents.
